  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/6zYpqnrbZy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yRY2Z3l.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"67\"></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@dariphersmods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Nrx7nR1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"67\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252fdaripher%252fdonate\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/byUOqSi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"67\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>将 <strong>Apotheosis</strong> 与 <strong>Curios&nbsp;API</strong> 模组整合，使任意 Curios 物品都能拥有 <strong>Apotheosis</strong> 的词缀与插槽。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Apotheosis</strong> 模组会让装备物品拥有不同的词缀，例如“+生命”、“+伤害”等。</p>\n<p>该系统类似于《暗黑破坏神》和《流放之路》等游戏中的物品词缀系统。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Curios API</strong> 允许你添加新的物品栏位，例如戒指、项链等。</p>\n<p><br><br>然而，<strong>Apotheosis</strong> 模组无法将这些新物品类型识别为装备。&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Apothic Curios</strong> 模组修复了该问题，并允许整合包开发者为 Curios 物品附加词缀。</p>\n<p><br><br>Curios 词缀示例：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Daripher/Apothic-Curios/tree/master/src/test/resources/data/apothiccurios/affixes/ring\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a></p>\n<p><br>可在 Curios 上使用的宝石示例：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Daripher/Apothic-Curios/tree/master/src/test/resources/data/apotheosis/gems\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.2</a>&nbsp;和&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Daripher/Apothic-Curios/tree/1.20.1/src/test/resources/data/apotheosis/gems\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.20.1</a></p>",
